#! /bin/sh -
# Site-specific startup actions. Sourced by /etc/rc at the end of multiuser
# boot, but only on a writable (SD) root - a ROM-backed root skips it.
#
# Persistent settings for the SD-root (GBAED) build go here: they are
# reapplied on every boot. For example, the on-screen keyboard's auto-repeat
# timing (milliseconds) - uncomment and adjust to taste:
#
#sysctl -w machdep.kbd_repeat_delay=400
#sysctl -w machdep.kbd_repeat_rate=100
